         "rule_named": "disc method"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Since \\( \\int_{0}^{3} 16 x^{4}\\,dx = \\frac{3888}{5} \\), the volume is \\( \\frac{3888 \\pi}{5} \\).",
